# Tailwind only

- Style with Tailwind utility classes. No inline `style`, CSS modules, CSS-in-JS, or extra `.css` files beyond `src/styles/index.css`.
- Mobile-first: base classes are the 376px mobile design; layer up with `md:`, `lg:`, `xl:`.
- Arbitrary values (`w-[425px]`) only for one-off spec dimensions. Anything used twice becomes a `@theme` token.
- Combine classes with the local `cn` helper in `src/shared/lib/cn.ts`. Do not add `clsx`, `tailwind-merge` or `cva`.

# Tokens (`src/styles/index.css`, `@theme`)

Tailwind v4's default palette uses OKLCH values that do NOT exactly match the spec. Override every color used with the exact hex values:

```css
@theme {
  --font-sans: "Inter Variable", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  --color-gray-900: #111827;
  --color-gray-700: #374151;
  --color-gray-600: #4b5563;
  --color-gray-500: #6b7280;
  --color-gray-400: #9ca3af;
  --color-gray-300: #d1d5db;
  --color-indigo-400: #818cf8;
  --color-indigo-500: #6366f1;
  --color-indigo-600: #4f46e5;
  --color-indigo-700: #4338ca;
  --color-indigo-300: #a5b4fc;
}
```

# Breakpoints (Tailwind v4 defaults)

| Spec frame | Width | Tailwind | Layout |
|---|---|---|---|
| Mobile | 376px | base | single column, stacked form, hamburger menu, illustration below content |
| Tablet | 834px | `md:` (≥768) | two columns, full horizontal nav, container flush to edges |
| Laptop | 1080px | `lg:` (≥1024) | two columns of 492px, horizontal form, centered container |
| Desktop | 1358px | `xl:` (≥1280) | inner container max 1280px centered (39px gutters come from mx-auto), 32px padding, two columns of 592px |

- The layout must also look correct between frames, not only at the exact frame widths.
- Verify at 376, 834, 1080 and 1358 against Figma before calling any UI task done.

# Fidelity

- Every spacing, size, radius, shadow and type value comes from @docs/design-spec.md. Do not round or approximate.
- The illustration container uses `overflow: clip` and scales with its column width.
